nk\" href=\"#next\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" id=\"e7693ca5-bf76-42df-999c-dbc3066cda9e\" data-name=\"Layer 1\" width=\"21.3525\" height=\"10.7197\" viewBox=\"0 0 21.3525 10.7197\"><polygon points=\"21 5.229 21.343 4.865 16.165 0 15.479 0.729 19.737 4.729 0 4.729 0 5.729 19.786 5.729 15.47 10.009 16.175 10.72 21.353 5.584 21 5.229\"><\/polygon><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb4a5ea e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bb4a5ea\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-124c8a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"124c8a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Alt elektrisk til din nye bolig<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84b8265 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"84b8265\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1455ad0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1455ad0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"629\">Bygger du nytt, er det viktig \u00e5 tenke elektrisk helt fra starten. Hos Stavanger Elektro f\u00e5r du r\u00e5dgivning og installasjon som dekker hele prosessen, fra prosjektering til sluttkontroll. Vi leverer l\u00f8sninger tilpasset dine behov, enten du vil ha et enkelt oppsett eller et komplett, fremtidsrettet smarthus.<\/p><p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"645\">Vi s\u00f8rger for:<\/p><ul data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"797\"><li data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"677\"><p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"677\">El-planlegging og kursoppsett<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"720\"><p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"720\">Sikringsskap, belysning og stikkontakter<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"760\"><p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"760\">Smarthus og energieffektive l\u00f8sninger<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"797\"><p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"797\">Dokumentasjon og samsvarserkl\u00e6ring<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"919\">Med oss f\u00e5r du et elektrisk anlegg som gir trygghet, komfort og fleksibilitet, ferdig montert og klart til innflytting.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01b9b8e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"01b9b8e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"397\" src=\"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/STAVANGER-ELEKTRO-IKON-GRONN.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-290\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-71db4ce e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"71db4ce\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8661db4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8661db4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Tre fordeler med Stavanger Elektro i nybygg\n\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b85191 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id